c2bf – C-to-Brainfuck transpiler

Usage: c2bf [command] [file] [options]

Compiles by default: `c2bf program.c -o program.bf` transpiles
program.c. Without -o, output goes to stdout; without a file, input
comes from stdin (`run` requires a file).

Commands:
  compile    Transpile C source to Brainfuck (the default command)
  run        Run a Brainfuck program
  format     Pretty-print Brainfuck (-m minifies)
  help       Show this help

Options:
  -c file    Code file (same as the positional file)
  -o file    Output file (default stdout)
  -i file    Input file for run (default stdin)
  -m         Minify (format only)
